    "text": "a a. 17. urnstruct\"™ or. \"Instructions\" shall mean. written communications signed: by an Authorized Person’ (including, without limitation, instructions received by telex or any other such. | systen, whereby the receiver of such communication is able to verify with a reasonable. degree” of” certainty the identity of the sender of such» communication). Coiba at ist"
  },
  {
